    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27312" root="طوف" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَافٌ</span></b>  A man <i>who goes round,</i> or <i>round about,
much,</i> or <i>often;</i> (S, O, K;) [and] so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَوَّافٌ</span></b> :
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَوَّافَةٌ</span></b>  a woman <i>who goes round,</i> or <i>round
about, much,</i> or <i>often, to the tents,</i> or <i>houses, of
her female neighbours.</i> (Msb.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طُوف</span>.

